  <ul>
    <li><strong>Epic Games — Quixel</strong> · Pipeline &amp; Automation Engineer (core developer &amp; architect) · Remote · Apr 2025 – Jul 2026</li>
    <li><strong>Blink Industries</strong> · Pipeline Developer · London (Remote) · Aug – Oct 2024</li>
    <li><strong>Untold Studios</strong> · Pipeline Developer · London (Remote) · Oct 2023 – May 2024</li>
    <li><strong>One Animation / Moonbug</strong> · Sr Pipeline TD · Singapore (Remote) · Sep 2022 – Sep 2023</li>
    <li><strong>Passion Pictures</strong> · Pipeline Developer · London (Remote) · Mar – Sep 2022</li>
    <li><strong>Nebula Pipeline</strong> · Studio Developer / Consultant · Karachi · 2019 – 2021</li>
    <li><strong>ICE Animations</strong> · Pipeline Supervisor / CG Researcher · Karachi · 2011 – 2019</li>
    <li><strong>Post Amazers</strong> · Technical Artist / Programmer · Karachi · 2004 – 2008</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="text-soft">Selected screen credits: <em>Mansour</em> (TV series, 2012), <em>Son of the Mask</em> (2005).</p>

  <h2>Education &amp; certifications</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>B.S. Computer Systems Engineering</strong> — GIK Institute, Pakistan (1999–2003)</li>
    <li><strong>EM CIMET</strong> (Erasmus Mundus) color-imaging &amp; multimedia coursework — U. of Granada &amp; Gjøvik UC (2008–2010)</li>
    <li><strong>P.G.D. Business Administration</strong> — IBA Karachi (2005–2007)</li>
    <li>Deep Learning Specialization — DeepLearning.ai / Coursera (2019) · AI &amp; GPT Applications — Encode.club (2024)</li>
  </ul>

  <hr />
  <p>
    Looking for pipeline / tools / automation / software roles. The fastest way to reach me is
    <a href="mailto:talha.ahmed@gmail.com">email</a> or
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/talha-ahmed-lazyleopard/">LinkedIn</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
